%% RESULT
%% The serialized proof bundle passes the independent primitive checker for all
%% four original atlas labels, comprising five equations (linearity has two
%% conjuncts). Every one of the 250 delivered primitive proof nodes is checked.
%% The four conclusions are source-equational proofs, not conclusions supplied
